Subject: Mark author datasets directory as a package to avoid Hugging Face shadowing

The shared GPU image contains an installed datasets package. Upstream has no
__init__.py, so Python resolves datasets.czech_slr_dataset to the unrelated
installed package. Preflight-001 demonstrated ModuleNotFoundError. An empty
package marker restores the author import without changing data or model behavior.

diff --git a/datasets/__init__.py b/datasets/__init__.py
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e69de29
